'''Immortals''' (abbreviated as '''IMT''') is an [[:Category:United States|American]] esports organization owned by [[wikipedia:Immortals Gaming Club|Immortals Gaming Club]] ('''IGC'''), primarily known for their ''League of Legends'' team.

==History==
{{See also|Immortals/History|l1=History of Immortals}}

===Timeline===
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2016
|name2=2017
|name3=2018
|This=3

|content3=
*January 21st - [[zqk]] is acquired by [[YeaH! Gaming]]. <ref name="zqk to YeaH">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/YeaHGaming/status/955138916838969346|title=Anunciando nossa nova line up de csgo!|trans_title=Announcing our new CSGO line up!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2018-01-21|publisher=[[YeaH! Gaming]]}}</ref>
*February 21st - [[lurppis]] joins as General Manager. <ref name="lurppis joins">{{cite web|url=https://www.immortals.gg/news/2018/02/21/immortals-adds-tomi-lurppis-kovanen-as-general-manager-of-csgo/|title=Immortals add Tomi "lurppis" Kovanen as General Manager of CS:GO|date=2018-02-21|publisher='''Immortals'''}}</ref>
*June 23rd - [[boltz]] is transferred to the [[MIBR]] team, which is owned by '''Immortals'''. <ref name="SK move to MIBR">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/mibr/status/1010621762407575552|title=Left in 1.6, back in CS:GO. WELCOME HOME!|date=2018-06-23|publisher=[[MIBR]]}}</ref>
*August 10th - [[horvy]]'s contract expires and he becomes a free agent.  <ref name="horvy free">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/horvyFPS/status/1025366130901360646|title=Free agent em 7 dias|trans_title=Free Agent in 7 days|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2018-08-10|author=[[horvy]]}}</ref>

|content2=
*February 5th - '''Immortals''' and [[SK Gaming]] swap [[felps]] and [[fnx]]. <ref name="felps fnx swap">{{cite web|url=http://www.sk-gaming.com/content/1870353-sk-gaming-brings-in-felps-as-csgo-fifth|date=2017-02-05|title=SK Gaming Brings in felps as CS:GO Fifth|author=[[Evgeni Chardakov]]|publisher=[[SK Gaming]]}}</ref>
*May 15th - '''Immortals''' bench [[fnx]] due to internal issues within the team. <ref name="fnx benched">{{cite web|url=https://business.facebook.com/Immortalsgg/photos/a.1504390876522096.1073741828.1504183073209543/1705889319705583/?type=3&theater|date=2017-05-15|title=The Immortals CS:GO team has been working hard to reach the next level of competition.|publisher='''Immortals'''}}</ref>
*May 24th - '''Immortals''' announce that [[kNgV-]] will tryout for the team on loan from [[Red Reserve]].  <ref name="kNg joins">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/Immortalsgg/photos/a.1504390876522096.1073741828.1504183073209543/1710563592571489/?type=3&theater|date=2017-05-24|title=We recently made some changes to our CS:GO roster in order to create a healthier, more sustainable environment.|publisher='''Immortals'''}}</ref>
*July 23rd - '''Immortals''' place 2nd at [[PGL/2017/Krakow|PGL Major Kraków 2017]], losing to [[Gambit Esports]] 1-2 in the grand-final.
*July 25th - [[kNgV-]] is acquired from [[Red Reserve]]. <ref name="kNg signed">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/21140/immortals-sign-kng|date=2017-07-25|title=Immortals sign kNg|author=Luis "[[MIRAA]]" Mira|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
*September 20th - '''Immortals''' parts ways with [[kNgV-]]. <ref name="kNg leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/kngvito/status/910344846774341633|date=2017-09-20|title=I am no longer part of Immortals|author=Vito Giuseppe|publisher=Twitter}}</ref>
*September 22nd - [[LUCAS1]] and [[HEN1]] are benched. <ref name="LUCAS1 HEN1 benched">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/21564/immortals-ceo-comments-on-team-issues|date=2017-09-22|title=Immortals CEO comments on team issues|author=Luis "[[MIRAA]]" Mira|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
*October 3rd - '''Immortals''' confirm the signing of [[horvy]]. <ref name="horvy joins Immortals">{{cite web|url=https://www.immortals.gg/news/2017/10/03/immortals-welcomes-joao-horvy-horvath-to-csgo-roster/|date=2017-10-03|title=Immortals Welcomes João “Horvy” Horvath to CS:GO Roster|publisher=Immortals}}</ref>
*October 10th - '''Immortals''' sign [[destiny]]. <ref name="destinyy joins immortals">{{cite web|url=https://www.immortals.gg/news/2017/10/10/immortals-csgo-welcomes-its-newest-permanent-member-lucas-destinyy-bullo-de-lima/|date=2017-10-10|title=Immortals CS:GO welcomes its newest permanent member, Lucas "Destinyy Bullo de Lima|publisher=Immortals}}</ref>
*October 13th - '''Immortals''' sign [[zqk]]. <ref name="zqkS joins immortals">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/21736/official-zqks-joins-immortals|title=Official: zqkS joins Immortals|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
*October 31st - [[TACO]] from [[SK Gaming]] announces that [[boltz]] will be playing for [[SK Gaming|SK]] on loan, but will remain playing for '''Immortals''' for the remainder of [[Esports_Championship_Series/Season_4/North_America|ECS Season 4]]. <ref name="boltz loaned to SK">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TACOCS/status/925364605202808834|title=Boltz jogará todo o resto com exceção do major e ECS. Muito em breve esperamos que ele vire oficialmente nosso quinto player.|trans_title="Boltz will play the rest except for the Major and ECS. We expect him to officially become our fifth player very soon."|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|author=[[TACO]]}}</ref>
*November 7th - '''Immortals''' confirm [[shz]] move. <ref name="Immortals confirm shz move">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/21974/immortals-confirm-shz-move|date=2017-11-07|title=Immortals confirm shz move|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
*November 13th - [[Steel_(Lucas_Lopes)|steel]] is transferred to [[Team Liquid]]. <ref name="steel to liquid">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/22020/steel-transferred-to-liquid|date=2017-11-13|title=steel transferred to Liquid|publisher=[[HLTV]]|author=Milan "[[Striker (Czech journalist)|Striker]]" Švejda}}</ref>
*December 1st - [[horvy]] announces he is going inactive on '''Immortals''' while looking for new opportunities with North American teams. <ref name="horvy moves to bench">{{cite web|url=http://www.twitlonger.com/show/n_1sqbi8f|date=2017-11-01|title=IMMORTALS and New challenges|author=[[horvy]]}}</ref>
*December 2nd - [[zakk]] announces his departure from '''Immortals'''. <ref name="zakk leaves immortals">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/News/323-zakk-exits-immortals|date=2017-11-02|title=zakk exits Immortals|author=[[CarbonDogma]]|publisher=Dust2.us}}</ref>
*December 12th - [[100 Thieves]] announce their acquisition of [[HEN1]], [[LUCAS1]], and [[fnx]]. <ref name="100Thieves acquire ex-Immortals">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100Thieves/status/940780971485306880|date=2017-12-12|title=We're proud to announce that 100 Thieves is officially entering into Counter-Strike: Global Offensive!|publisher=[[100 Thieves]]}}</ref>
*December 21st - [[Tempo Storm]] announces their acquisition of [[shz]] and [[destiny]]. <ref name="destinyy and shz out">{{cite web|url=https://tempostorm.com/articles/welcome-back-destinyy-shz|date=2017-12-21|title=Welcome back, destinyy and shz! An update to our CS:GO BR roster!|publisher=[[Tempo Storm]]}}</ref>

|content1=
*June 1st - '''Immortals''' acquires the roster of [[Tempo Storm]]. <ref name="Immortals buys TS team">{{cite web|url=http://espn.go.com/esports/story/_/id/15879732/immortals-purchase-tempo-storm-counter-strike-team|date=2016-06-01|title=Immortals purchase Tempo Storm's Counter-Strike team|author=[[Jacob Wolf]]|publisher=[[ESPN]]}}</ref>
*July 22nd - '''Immortals''' replace [[SHOOWTiME]] with [[zews]] - who was the coach of the core of the roster during their team with [[Games Academy]]. <ref name="zews in, SHOOWTiME out">{{cite web|url=https://www.thescoreesports.com/news/9280|date=2016-07-22|title=Immortals sign Zews|author=Josh Bury|publisher=The Score eSports}}</ref>
*November 4th - '''Immortals''' replace [[zews]] with [[steel (Brazilian player)|steel]]. <ref name="zews out, steel in">{{cite web|url=http://mycnb.uol.com.br/noticias/4855-immortals-troca-zews-por-steel-e-provoca-efeito-domino-no-cs-brasileiro|date=2016-11-04|title=Immortals troca zews por steel|trans_title=Immortals change zews for steel|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|publisher=[[CNB e-Sports Club]]}}</ref>
}}

